{"title":"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/b/93bc4d60c7a4793458e6ce0dc6280d11bc9f6c8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|3-\\pi|=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/f/94f2f375a1ffd20853a84ec6d78cdab3747c2a4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)\\ }\\frac{1}{7}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)\\ }0.14\\qquad\\textbf{(C)\\ }3-\\pi\\qquad\\textbf{(D)\\ }3+\\pi\\qquad\\textbf{(E)\\ }\\pi-3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"479\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/b/c3b67094ee0272f4dbaf89b4dcb2439c8a7f5eda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pi&gt;3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" />, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/9/219acb30d893e592dd53463614e2b06ba2babe68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-\\pi$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> is negative. The absolute value of a negative quantity is the negative quantity multiplied by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, or the negative of that quantity. Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/d/ecd4385a7439017d282c1ab16bf8404483a695b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|3-\\pi|=-(3-\\pi)=\\pi-3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"213\" height=\"18\" />, which is choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/1/3711217e5f5d573cdedc2efeb489063c5d6ed51e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{E}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME\" title=\"1991 AHSME\">1991 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1991 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1991\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1991 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" ti